---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const updated = new Date('2026-11-17');
---

<PageLayout
	title="Now | Itziar Morales"
	description="What I'm doing these days. A now page."
>
	<p class="eyebrow">~/now</p>
	<h1>Now</h1>
	<p class="updated">
		Last updated <time datetime={updated.toISOString().slice(0, 10)}>
			{updated.toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' })}
		</time> · this is a <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener">now page</a>
	</p>

	<h2>Working</h2>
	<p>
		Interning remotely at MGA as a software engineering intern, deep in the data-engineering side of
		a digital transformation: relational schema design, migrating years of spreadsheet data into
		PostgreSQL, and Spring Boot services on top. Learning a lot about the gap between how a business
		says it works and what its data actually does.
	</p>
	<p>
		Alongside it, I'm rebuilding the website of a psychology practice, moving it from WordPress to a
		static site on Cloudflare with a secure contact form. And once a week I teach a catch-up Calculus
		class at U-tad as part of its Excellence Programme.
	</p>

	<h2>Studying</h2>
	<p>
		In my final year of Software Engineering at U-tad. The thesis is on the same theme as the
		internship: how you replace legacy spreadsheet workflows without breaking the people who rely
		on them.
	</p>
	<p>On the side:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><a href="https://www.udemy.com/course/spring-hibernate-tutorial/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Spring &amp; Hibernate</a> (Udemy): backend upskilling for work</li>
		<li><a href="https://www.udemy.com/course/sql-and-postgresql/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SQL &amp; PostgreSQL</a> (Udemy): same mission, database side</li>
		<li>French: chipping away, aiming for the DELF B1 in 2027</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Building</h2>
	<p>
		A daily pipeline of Spain's electricity mix: Python pulls Red Eléctrica's open data into PostgreSQL,
		dbt models and tests it, and a <a href="https://itzi97.github.io/spain-electricity-pipeline/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">small public dashboard</a>
		shows how much of the grid ran on renewables each day. Write-up coming once it has a few weeks of data.
	</p>
	<p>
		On the side, still slowly rewriting <a href="https://github.com/itzi97/engine2d" target="_blank" rel="noopener">engine2d</a>.
	</p>

	<style>
		.updated {
			color: var(--text-muted);
			font-size: 0.85em;
		}
		ul {
			padding-left: 1.25em;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 0.3em;
		}
		li {
			font-size: 0.92em;
		}
	</style>
</PageLayout>
